a GET behind a body: 200 10 octets / 200 hello
a reset download: 200 1 10 octets
past its length: 200 yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy, reset 2 after 2 DATA / then 200 hello
short of its length: 200 yyyyyyyyyy, reset 2 after 1 DATA / then 200 hello
a failing producer: 200 yyyyyyyyyy, reset 2 after 1 DATA / then 200 hello
an empty stream: 200  / then 200 hello
an upgrade: 500  / then 200 hello
an interim status: 500  / then 200 hello
HEAD over a stream: 200  / then 200 hello
a body never read: 200 not read, reset 0 after 1 DATA / then 200 hello
a reset upload: silent / then 200 5 broke
producers released: 200 5 broke / then 200 hello
